WEBVTT

00:00.894 --> 00:03.790
<i>[bright music]</i>
<i>[明亮的音乐]</i>

00:03.859 --> 00:10.480
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

00:10.549 --> 00:11.790
[hums]
[哼哼]

00:11.859 --> 00:14.066
Let's go!
Come on!
我们走吧！
快点！

00:14.135 --> 00:15.515
Huh?
啊？

00:15.584 --> 00:17.722
Hey, what's the hold up
in there?
嘿，有什么好坚持的
在那里？

00:17.790 --> 00:20.790
You're acting like you've never
cooked a Krabby Patty before.
你的表现就像你从未有过一样
之前煮过蟹肉饼。

00:20.859 --> 00:23.273
[bell rings]
- Yeah, Dad, that's because
[铃声响起]
- 是的，爸爸，那是因为

00:23.342 --> 00:26.446
I never have cooked
a Krabby Patty before.
我从来没有煮过饭
之前有一个蟹肉饼。

00:26.515 --> 00:29.377
Why are you making me do this?
你为什么要让我这么做？

00:29.446 --> 00:31.653
Because today is bring...
因为今天带来的是...

00:31.722 --> 00:35.101
I mean, put your daughter
to work day.
我的意思是，把你的女儿
到工作日。

00:35.170 --> 00:38.446
Besides, SpongeBob is busy deep
cleaning the barrel chairs.
此外，海绵宝宝很忙
清洁桶椅。

00:38.515 --> 00:40.480
[hums]
[哼哼]

00:40.549 --> 00:42.515
Uh, do you mind?
呃，你介意吗？

00:42.584 --> 00:44.066
Oh, no, not at all.
哦，不，一点也不。

00:44.135 --> 00:46.756
[whistles]
- [groans]
[口哨声]
- [呻吟]

00:46.825 --> 00:48.790
Here's your food or whatever.
这是你的食物或者其他什么。

00:48.859 --> 00:51.687
Oh, hi, SpongeBob.
- Hi, Pearl.
哦，嗨，海绵宝宝。
- 嗨，珍珠。

00:51.756 --> 00:54.997
Isn't this just
the best job ever?
这不就是
有史以来最好的工作？

00:55.066 --> 00:56.342
[grunts]
[咕哝]

00:58.549 --> 01:00.963
[gasps]
Hmm.
[喘气]
嗯。

01:01.032 --> 01:03.273
- How do, SpongeBob!
- [screams]
- 怎么办，海绵宝宝！
- [尖叫]

01:03.342 --> 01:04.756
Narlene.
纳琳。

01:04.825 --> 01:06.480
Hey, where's your brother,
Nobby?
嘿，你弟弟在哪儿
诺比？

01:06.549 --> 01:08.549
[groans]
[呻吟]

01:08.618 --> 01:10.101
Ma'am.
女士。

01:10.170 --> 01:13.687
Me and Nobby was just
on our way to the big city,
我和诺比只是
在我们去大城市的路上，

01:13.756 --> 01:15.687
so we thought we'd take you up
所以我们想带你上去

01:15.756 --> 01:18.273
on your offer
to show us the sights.
根据您的报价
向我们展示景点。

01:18.342 --> 01:20.411
Ooh, I'd love to.
哦，我很愿意。

01:20.480 --> 01:22.997
We can say hi
to my favorite fire hydrant
我们可以打个招呼
到我最喜欢的消防栓

01:23.066 --> 01:25.756
and then we can see the old man
that feeds the clams
然后我们就可以看到老人了
喂蛤蜊的

01:25.825 --> 01:28.342
and then... no.
然后...不。

01:28.411 --> 01:31.411
I can't abandon
these lovely people.
我不能放弃
这些可爱的人。

01:31.480 --> 01:33.549
all: [chewing and burping]
全部：[咀嚼和打嗝]

01:33.618 --> 01:37.342
Ooh, then why don't
I show you around the big city?
哦，那为什么不呢
我带你参观大城市？

01:37.411 --> 01:39.515
I don't care about these people.
我不关心这些人。

01:39.584 --> 01:42.342
Little Pearly's gonna
take us on an adventure?
小珍珠会
带我们去冒险？

01:42.411 --> 01:43.790
Hot dippity!
热辣辣的！

01:43.859 --> 01:45.722
Anything to get out
of this place.
什么都可以出去
这个地方的。

01:45.790 --> 01:47.963
It'll be a whale's day out.
这将是鲸鱼的一天。

01:48.032 --> 01:50.997
[grunts]
Hard day's work.
[咕哝]
辛苦了一天。

01:51.066 --> 01:54.135
[grunts]
- [groans]
[咕哝]
- [呻吟]

01:54.204 --> 01:56.273
Nobby says he's fixing to stay
诺比说他决定留下来

01:56.342 --> 01:58.377
and help SpongeBob
with the hungry folk.
并帮助海绵宝宝
与饥饿的人们一起。

01:58.446 --> 02:02.480
So, Pearl, looks like
we got ourselves a deal.
所以，珍珠，看起来像
我们达成了协议。

02:02.549 --> 02:03.859
[hocks, spits]
[飞节，吐口水]

02:04.963 --> 02:07.273
- Okay.
- This'll be great.
- 好的。
- 这会很棒的。

02:07.342 --> 02:11.515
Two whale gals reconnoitering
the big city together.
两只鲸鱼女孩在侦察
大城市在一起。

02:11.584 --> 02:14.618
If we want to do that
"noitering" thing in the city,
如果我们想这么做
城市里的“闹事”，

02:14.687 --> 02:17.446
I'll need an advance
on my allowance.
我需要预付款
在我的津贴上。

02:17.515 --> 02:19.308
Oh, Daddy!
哦，爸爸！

02:20.894 --> 02:24.032
[groans]
All right, here you go.
[呻吟]
好吧，给你。

02:24.101 --> 02:26.584
Ugh, Dad, we can't have
a whale's day out
呃，爸爸，我们不能
鲸鱼出游的一天

02:26.653 --> 02:28.515
with your balsa wood card.
用您的轻木卡。

02:28.584 --> 02:31.859
We need the diamond unlimited!
我们需要无限的钻石！

02:31.928 --> 02:33.963
My diamond.
我的钻石。

02:34.584 --> 02:37.411
[horn honks]
- I never took a Scuber before,
[喇叭鸣响]
- 我以前从未拿过Scuber，

02:37.480 --> 02:39.515
but it sure is
mighty convenient.
但确实如此
非常方便。

02:39.584 --> 02:42.273
'Preciate the lift.
[grunts]
'珍惜电梯。
[咕哝]

02:42.342 --> 02:43.790
Huh?
啊？

02:43.859 --> 02:45.411
I'll be!
我会的！

02:45.480 --> 02:49.239
These city streets is paved
with chewing candy.
这些城市街道已铺好
与咀嚼糖。

02:49.308 --> 02:52.653
[grunts]
I'm saving you as a souvenir.
[咕哝]
我把你留作纪念。

02:52.722 --> 02:55.101
Ah.
啊。

02:55.170 --> 02:56.825
Ah!
啊!

02:56.894 --> 02:58.446
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

02:58.515 --> 02:59.825
Mm.
毫米。

02:59.894 --> 03:01.859
Ah!
Tasty.
啊!
可口。

03:01.928 --> 03:03.790
Uh, the city also has
呃，这个城市也有

03:03.859 --> 03:06.377
a lot of things in it
that aren't gross.
里面有很多东西
这并不恶心。

03:06.446 --> 03:07.825
Really?
真的吗？

03:07.894 --> 03:10.204
Oh,
like these fancy shacks here?
哦，
喜欢这里这些别致的小屋吗？

03:10.273 --> 03:14.342
Yeah, these are skyscrapers.
是的，这些是摩天大楼。

03:14.411 --> 03:16.308
And that?
那呢？

03:16.377 --> 03:18.584
That's public transportation.
那是公共交通。

03:18.653 --> 03:19.928
Ow.
噢。

03:19.997 --> 03:21.894
[jackhammer rattling]
- What's he doing?
[手提钻嘎嘎作响]
- 他在做什么？

03:21.963 --> 03:25.549
Street construction!
街道建设！

03:25.618 --> 03:27.204
[laughs]
[笑]

03:29.653 --> 03:31.549
[groans]
Ooh.
[呻吟]
哦。

03:31.618 --> 03:34.997
Why, it's like
walking through a TV show.
为什么，就像
走过电视节目。

03:37.584 --> 03:38.997
Phew.
Ah.
唷。
啊。

03:39.066 --> 03:40.653
[timer beeping]
Huh?
[定时器蜂鸣声]
啊？

03:40.722 --> 03:44.928
Uh-oh, the fries.
If only I could reach them.
呃哦，薯条。
如果我能联系到他们就好了。

03:44.997 --> 03:47.859
[yelping, grunting]
[尖叫，咕噜声]

03:49.687 --> 03:51.032
Oh.
哦。

03:51.101 --> 03:52.859
Wow. Thanks, Nobby.
哇。谢谢，诺比。

03:52.928 --> 03:55.308
Now if only the condiments
were closer.
现在只要调味品
更接近了。

03:55.377 --> 03:57.618
- [grunts] Here you go.
- Ah.
- [咕哝]给你。
- 啊。

03:57.687 --> 04:00.446
- [babbling]
- [laughs]
- [胡言乱语]
- [笑]

04:00.515 --> 04:03.825
Too bad the bun rack is
on the other side of the room.
可惜面包架是
在房间的另一边。

04:05.859 --> 04:09.170
Oh, yeah!
This is what I call fast food!
哦，是啊！
这就是我所说的快餐！

04:12.411 --> 04:14.859
This is my favorite
department store
这是我最喜欢的
department store

04:14.928 --> 04:17.894
and, like,
the heart of the big city.
并且，就像，
the heart of the big city.

04:17.963 --> 04:19.411
Upturn's.
回升的。

04:19.480 --> 04:22.377
<i>[energetic music]</i>
<i>[充满活力的音乐]</i>

04:22.446 --> 04:25.790
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

04:25.859 --> 04:28.653
Whoa.
哇哦。

04:28.722 --> 04:29.928
Huh?
啊？

04:29.997 --> 04:31.859
Ooh!
哦！

04:31.928 --> 04:35.066
[groaning]
[呻吟]

04:35.135 --> 04:37.790
These here automatic doors
sure is frilly,
这里的这些自动门
当然是褶边，

04:37.859 --> 04:42.653
but we hill folk do things
a little more polite-like.
但我们山民做事
更有礼貌一点。

04:42.722 --> 04:44.790
[grunts]
Right this way, sir.
[咕哝]
这边走，先生。

04:44.859 --> 04:46.928
[groans]
[呻吟]

04:48.790 --> 04:51.101
Excuse me!
打扰一下！

04:51.170 --> 04:53.204
What do you think you're doing?
你认为你在做什么？

04:53.273 --> 04:56.549
Uh, holding the door.
Here, you try.
呃，扶着门。
在这里，你试试。

04:56.618 --> 05:00.549
- [groans]
- Narlene, that's Lady Upturn.
- [呻吟]
- 纳琳，那是Upturn女士。

05:00.618 --> 05:02.756
[groans, huffs]
[呻吟，怒气]

05:02.825 --> 05:05.273
[laughs]
I'm so sorry.
[笑]
我很抱歉。

05:05.342 --> 05:08.859
She's new in town,
but we'll be good shoppers.
她刚进城，
但我们会成为好的购物者。

05:08.928 --> 05:12.066
I swear.
- Hmm, yes.
我发誓。
- 嗯，是的。

05:12.135 --> 05:16.170
All right, carry on,
my little consumerists.
好吧，继续，
我的小消费主义者。

05:16.239 --> 05:20.308
But here at Upturn's,
we take shopping seriously.
但在Upturn's这里，
我们认真对待购物。

05:20.377 --> 05:21.584
both: Okay.
两人：好的。

05:25.342 --> 05:28.653
Welcome to
the perfume department.
欢迎来到
香水部。

05:28.722 --> 05:31.618
<i>[sweeping music]</i>
<i>[席卷音乐]</i>

05:31.687 --> 05:33.790
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

05:33.859 --> 05:35.342
[grunts]
[咕哝]

05:37.308 --> 05:39.997
[coughs and sneezes]
[咳嗽和打喷嚏]

05:40.066 --> 05:41.584
Phew-wee!
唷！

05:41.653 --> 05:44.377
I think something
done died up in here.
我觉得有件事
完成死在这里。

05:44.446 --> 05:47.066
Died and went to heaven!
死后去了天堂！

05:47.135 --> 05:50.170
Yeah!
[laughing]
是的！
[笑]

05:51.997 --> 05:54.032
[sighs]
[叹气]

05:54.101 --> 05:56.170
Ambergris.
[laughs]
龙涎香。
[笑]

05:56.239 --> 05:58.032
I... [chokes]
我……[窒息]

05:58.101 --> 06:00.032
[yelping]
[尖叫]

06:00.101 --> 06:01.894
Why, you!
为什么，你！

06:01.963 --> 06:03.618
Yes?
是的？

06:03.687 --> 06:05.377
What's your problem?
你有什么问题吗？

06:05.446 --> 06:08.825
I've got a cleanup on aisle you.
我已经帮你清理过道了。

06:08.894 --> 06:11.342
Perhaps another sample spritz?
也许还有一个样品喷雾？

06:11.411 --> 06:14.790
Sorry, but I ain't too
'ticular about that stench.
抱歉，但我也不是
特别是那种恶臭。

06:14.859 --> 06:15.997
Really.
真的。

06:16.066 --> 06:19.342
Besides, I carry my own
signature stink.
除此之外，我还带着自己的
签名臭。

06:19.411 --> 06:22.273
- Huh?
- Toadstool tang.
- 啊？
- 毒菌汤。

06:22.342 --> 06:24.411
[laughs]
Wa-hoo!
[笑]
哇呼！

06:25.790 --> 06:28.066
My nose!
我的鼻子！

06:28.135 --> 06:30.859
The horrible stench!
可怕的恶臭！

06:30.928 --> 06:32.756
- [coughs]
- [groans]
- [咳嗽]
- [呻吟]

06:32.825 --> 06:35.239
[all screaming]
[所有人尖叫]

06:35.308 --> 06:37.515
Come on, we better cheese it!
来吧，我们最好干酪了！

06:38.790 --> 06:42.101
What do you think
about this cool dress?
你觉得怎么样
关于这件很酷的衣服？

06:42.170 --> 06:45.687
I don't know.
It's kind of constricting.
我不知道。
这有点收缩。

06:45.756 --> 06:46.928
both: [laughs]
两人：[笑]

06:46.997 --> 06:48.722
<i>Attention, Upturn's shoppers.</i>
<i>Upturn 的购物者请注意。</i>

06:48.790 --> 06:50.653
<i>There's a sale
in the shoe department.</i>
<i>有促销活动
在鞋类部门。</i>

06:50.722 --> 06:51.997
<i>Tenth floor.</i>
- [gasps] Come on!
<i>十楼。</i>
- [喘气]来吧！

06:52.066 --> 06:53.618
Whoa!
哇！

06:53.687 --> 06:55.411
[elevator dinging]
[电梯叮叮声]

06:55.480 --> 06:58.204
Whoa.
[elevator dings]
哇哦。
[电梯叮叮声]

06:58.273 --> 07:01.687
No way.
So many shoes!
决不。
这么多鞋子！

07:01.756 --> 07:03.722
[laughs]
[笑]

07:03.790 --> 07:04.790
Huh?
啊？

07:07.066 --> 07:08.722
[gasps]
[喘气]

07:08.790 --> 07:10.204
[sighs]
[叹气]

07:10.273 --> 07:12.515
- [gasps]
- [laughs]
- [喘气]
- [笑]

07:12.584 --> 07:15.411
Uh, no offense, Pearly girl,
呃，无意冒犯，珍珠女孩，

07:15.480 --> 07:18.480
but my feet
don't cotton much to shoes.
但我的脚
鞋子上不要涂太多棉。

07:18.549 --> 07:21.239
As the saying goes,
there's a tiny shoe
俗话说，
有一只小鞋

07:21.308 --> 07:23.687
for every giant foot.
- Whoa!
对于每一个巨大的脚。
- 哇！

07:23.756 --> 07:25.170
May I?
我可以？

07:25.239 --> 07:28.515
Well, if the shoe fits.
好吧，如果鞋子合脚的话。

07:28.584 --> 07:30.584
[sniffing]
[嗅嗅]

07:30.653 --> 07:33.308
[growling]
[咆哮]

07:33.377 --> 07:35.928
You slaughtered my stiletto!
你杀了我的高跟鞋！

07:35.997 --> 07:38.101
Sorry.
I told you.
对不起。
我告诉你了。

07:38.170 --> 07:40.342
Wait a minute.
I know you two.
等一下。
我认识你们两个。

07:40.411 --> 07:42.446
You're those hooligans!
你们就是那些流氓！

07:42.515 --> 07:45.135
It's those wily whales.
就是那些狡猾的鲸鱼。

07:45.204 --> 07:47.308
Code red!
红色代码！

07:47.377 --> 07:49.273
[alarm blaring]
[警报声]

07:49.342 --> 07:51.756
[elevator dings]
both: [grunting]
[电梯叮叮声]
两人：[咕哝]

07:51.825 --> 07:54.756
[laughs and grunts]
[笑声和咕哝声]

07:54.825 --> 07:56.411
[soldiers grunting]
[士兵咕哝]

07:56.480 --> 07:58.204
- Hut, hut, hut, hut, hut, hut!
- Ha!
- 小屋，小屋，小屋，小屋，小屋，小屋！
- 哈！

07:58.273 --> 07:59.801
Hut, hut, hut, hut,
hut, hut, hut, hut, hut.
小屋，小屋，小屋，小屋，
小屋，小屋，小屋，小屋，小屋。

07:59.825 --> 08:01.756
<i>[dramatic music]</i>
<i>[戏剧音乐]</i>

08:01.825 --> 08:03.135
Ah!
啊!

08:03.204 --> 08:05.480
Lady Upturn!
Sorry.
女士逆袭！
对不起。

08:05.549 --> 08:08.032
Narlene and I
were just having some fun.
纳琳和我
我们只是玩得开心。

08:08.101 --> 08:09.308
Fun?
乐趣？

08:09.377 --> 08:12.687
Shopping is
not supposed to be fun.
购物是
不应该很有趣。

08:12.756 --> 08:14.170
Fortunately for me,
对我来说幸运的是，

08:14.239 --> 08:17.342
you'll never
be shopping here again!
你永远不会
再次来这里购物！

08:17.411 --> 08:20.618
But I had
the diamond unlimited card.
但我有
钻石无限卡。

08:20.687 --> 08:22.204
[cries]
[哭声]

08:22.273 --> 08:24.653
all: Hut, hut, hut,
hut, hut, hut, hut.
全部： 小屋，小屋，小屋，
小屋，小屋，小屋，小屋。

08:24.722 --> 08:27.584
- Come on, let's get.
- Ah!
- 来吧，我们开始吧。
- 啊！

08:27.653 --> 08:29.204
[grunts]
[咕哝]

08:29.273 --> 08:32.308
<i>[mellow music playing]</i>
<i>[柔和的音乐播放]</i>

08:32.377 --> 08:35.239
[elevator dings]
both: [panting]
[电梯叮叮声]
两人：[气喘吁吁]

08:35.308 --> 08:37.618
Whoa!
[elevator dings]
哇！
[电梯叮叮声]

08:37.687 --> 08:39.584
all: Hut, hut, hut,
hut, hut, hut, hut, hut.
全部： 小屋，小屋，小屋，
小屋，小屋，小屋，小屋，小屋。

08:39.653 --> 08:42.790
You, young ladies,
do not belong here,
你们，年轻的女士们，
不属于这里，

08:42.859 --> 08:44.722
especially her.
尤其是她。

08:44.790 --> 08:45.928
Huh?
啊？

08:45.997 --> 08:47.963
So what if my friend
doesn't do things
那如果我的朋友
不做事

08:48.032 --> 08:49.722
the way city people do?
城里人怎么做？

08:49.790 --> 08:53.480
At least she's not
a stuck-up snob like you.
至少她不是
像你这样自以为是的势利小人

08:53.549 --> 08:55.377
- Oh!
- Besides.
- 哦！
- 除了。

08:55.446 --> 08:57.204
- Mm.
- we cetacean sisters
- 毫米。
- 我们鲸类姐妹

08:57.273 --> 08:58.928
always stick together.
永远粘在一起。

08:58.997 --> 09:00.618
[yelps, grunts]
[尖叫声，咕噜声]

09:02.066 --> 09:04.928
Ah! Ah.
啊!啊。

09:04.997 --> 09:06.273
[grunts, heaves]
[咕哝声，起伏]

09:06.342 --> 09:07.997
[all grunt]
[全都咕哝]

09:08.066 --> 09:10.135
- Oh!
- [grunting]
- 哦！
- [咕哝]

09:10.204 --> 09:12.273
- Yee-haw!
- Hey!
- 哎呀！
- 嘿！

09:12.342 --> 09:14.170
[blowing whistle]
[吹口哨]

09:14.239 --> 09:15.894
Ha-ha, whoa.
哈哈，哇。

09:15.963 --> 09:18.480
[all grunting]
[全都咕哝]

09:18.549 --> 09:20.618
[grunts]
[咕哝]

09:20.687 --> 09:22.618
[laughs]
[笑]

09:23.687 --> 09:25.825
[screams]
all: Hut, hut, hut, hut.
[尖叫声]
全部：小屋，小屋，小屋，小屋。

09:25.894 --> 09:28.997
Diamond unlimited!
钻石无限！

09:29.066 --> 09:32.032
[screams]
[尖叫声]

09:32.101 --> 09:34.653
<i>[playful music]</i>
<i>[有趣的音乐]</i>

09:34.722 --> 09:36.204
I've got it.
我明白了。

09:36.273 --> 09:40.101
<i>♪ ♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>
<i>♪♪</i>

09:40.170 --> 09:42.411
both: [groans]
两人：[呻吟]

09:44.066 --> 09:45.618
Huh? Ah!
- [yelps]
啊？啊!
- [尖叫声]

09:45.687 --> 09:47.825
[babbling]
[胡说]

09:47.894 --> 09:49.756
My bad.
我的不好。

09:49.825 --> 09:51.722
[whistles]
[口哨声]

09:51.790 --> 09:54.653
- [yells]
- Aw!
- [大喊]
- 噢！

09:54.722 --> 09:56.790
[grunts]
[咕哝]

09:56.859 --> 09:58.859
Looks like
they worked you like a horse.
看起来像
他们像马一样让你工作。

09:58.928 --> 10:00.687
- Yeah.
- Aw.
- 是的。
- 噢。

10:02.273 --> 10:03.377
Oh.
- [whinnies]
哦。
- [嘶嘶声]

10:03.446 --> 10:04.687
both: [laughs]
两人：[笑]

10:04.756 --> 10:06.825
Thanks for
the whale's day out, Pearl,
谢谢
鲸鱼外出的一天，珍珠，

10:06.894 --> 10:09.790
but the big city's
more trouble than it's worth.
但大城市的
麻烦多于其价值。

10:09.859 --> 10:13.308
Next time, you're coming
to the countryside.
下次你也来
到乡下。

10:13.377 --> 10:15.963
- [laughs]
- Yeah, let's do that sometime.
- [笑]
- 是的，我们找个时间这样做吧。

10:16.032 --> 10:18.687
Yee-haw!
[laughs]
呀呀！
[笑]

10:20.342 --> 10:25.411
Pearl, what's the deal with
all these charges at Upturn's?
珍珠，这是怎么回事
Upturn 的所有这些费用？

10:25.480 --> 10:26.722
Why wait?
为什么要等？

10:26.790 --> 10:29.377
Let's go to the countryside
right now.
我们去乡村吧
现在。

10:29.446 --> 10:32.584
<i>[upbeat western music]</i>
<i>[欢快的西方音乐]</i>

10:32.653 --> 10:34.859
Goodbye, Daddy!
See you real soon.
再见，爸爸！
很快就能见到你了。

10:34.928 --> 10:36.997
- Sooner than you think!
- [screams]
- 比你想象的要早！
- [尖叫]

10:37.066 --> 10:38.170
Wait, wait!
等等，等等！

10:38.239 --> 10:39.101
Where do you think you're going?
你认为你要去哪里？

10:39.170 --> 10:41.066
You can't go away now!
你现在不能走！

10:41.135 --> 10:43.859
Hello?
Anybody there?
你好？
有人在吗？

你好？
有人在吗？